# Section 4's land masters (docs/specs/section-4-world.md 3, "Provenance"): the pictures stay out of git; their sums
# are committed, so a copy can be checked with `shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS` from this folder. scripts/room/lands.py
# writes both (its sums stage), and work/SHA256SUMS for every mask and generator output work/ holds (the folder's own
# SHA256SUMS pins that file in turn).
*
!.gitignore
!SHA256SUMS
!work/
work/*
!work/SHA256SUMS
